{"data":{"body":"[P2] Return to design for the new logging feature\n\nRule 3, \u201cWrite a design note before the code,\u201d applies to new features independently of public API changes. This adds a counter and documented log field, but the description explicitly declares a design note unnecessary because no public API changes. That bypasses the required design agreement. Following rules 8 and 9, return to the design phase: document the problem, cause, simpler alternatives, chosen approach, and removals, and obtain maintainer agreement before continuing.","comment_node_id":"","finding_digest":"fb8ae1d029ffaba60a251d2552739b481bfa25fbaae509369aab4d69fd039bea","finding_id":"arf_v1_7ofodubj76v2mcrfdusve443ja","finding_key":"compute-worker/agentcore/worker.py::_jobrunner::feature-without-design-note","identity_key":"compute-worker/agentcore/worker.py::_jobrunner::feature-without-design-note","line":186,"observation_digest":"82ec26278290b31db7bef279bea2bfc4d866064380275dac576e5006ab764d97","observation_id":"aro_v1_qlwcmj4csczr3n566j435iv7yt","path":"packages/aws-durable-execution-sdk-python-compute-worker/src/aws_durable_execution_sdk_python_compute_worker/agentcore/worker.py","prior_finding_id":"arf_v1_7ofodubj76v2mcrfdusve443ja","published_at":"2026-11-24T21:55:57Z","review_id":"arr_v1_osoqo4zgotmi3vj7pwpkoycd7u","reviewed_base_sha":"0c3fb8b6849a12317b490266c833ff630979a555","reviewed_head_sha":"65ba0d67ef58331e51e887173764a0a22e79c55a","reviewer":"codex","start_line":186,"suggestion_id":"","suppressed":true,"suppression_status":"out-of-scope"},"pull_request":{"number":956},"record_id":"art_v1_7dfuhw23h7g24luukxnens57e3","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-11-24T21:55:57Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-python","id":1052903600},"schema_version":1}
